# Studex Computer — operator appliance (sold unit)

Runbook: `docs/TWO_SITES_COMPUTE_TIERS.md` · POV course air-gap step

**Not Dark Factory** — no factory secrets, no client GCP keys, no ZTE write access.

## Operator stack (on device)

- [ ] Ollama + LiteLLM :4000 — local models only
- [ ] Mission Control served locally (no public inbound)
- [ ] Studbot web or Android unlock with studexmeat subscription email
- [ ] Air-gap test: agent loop with network disabled (course checkpoint)

## Avoid on appliance

- [ ] No Paperclip admin keys
- [ ] No OmniRoute cloud provider keys (optional offline-only)
- [ ] No VNC exposed; physical console or Tailscale opt-in only

## Handoff from factory

- [ ] Image built and signed on Dark Factory; artifact hash recorded in vault (not git)
- [ ] Buyer gets **Studex Computer** tier doc only — not `dark-factory.md`